---
// src/pages/about/index.astro
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Our Story & Heart | Will Meet Soon" 
  description="Discover the mission, love, and heart behind Will Meet Soon, the comfort sanctuary for couples bridging the distance."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <!-- Header Hero -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#261E2C]/90 rounded-full border border-[#F0E5DC] dark:border-[#3D3145] shadow-sm mb-8">
        <span class="text-sm">🌸</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] tracking-wide">
          Our Heart & Mission
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-normal text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-balance">
        Bridging the distance <br />
        <span class="italic bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E15B7B] via-[#FB923C] to-[#F59E0B] bg-clip-text text-transparent font-medium">
          between two hearts
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-light text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-pretty">
        Will Meet Soon was created with a simple, tender truth in mind: true love is never defined by geography. We build gentle tools to help long-distance couples feel close every single day.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Section -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16 space-y-10">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="card-cozy p-8 sm:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FDE8EF] dark:bg-[#E15B7B]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
          <span>💌</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] mb-4">The Realities of Loving from Afar</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Over 14 million couples around the world are separated by miles, flights, borders, and oceans. While video calls and messaging keep us in touch, they don't erase the ache of physical separation or the administrative stress of logistics.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Unexpected 40% customs duty taxes on surprise gifts, confusing timezone math that turns coordinate efforts into headaches, and repetitive calls with nothing new to share can leave couples feeling drained. We wanted to build a gentle haven that takes away the friction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="card-cozy p-8 sm:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFF1E6] dark:bg-[#FB923C]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
          <span>🕊️</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] mb-4">Our Gentle Principles</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Technology should nurture human warmth, not make it feel like work. Everything we design centers around three loving promises:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] font-light">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#E15B7B] dark:text-[#FBBF24] font-bold mt-0.5">♡</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] font-medium">Border-Free Gifting:</strong> Sourcing items directly from stores inside your partner's country so surprises arrive duty-free without customs holds.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#FB923C] font-bold mt-0.5">♡</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] font-medium">Golden Hour Overlaps:</strong> Spotting mutual free hours where one is sipping morning coffee while the other winds down for sleep.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#10B981] font-bold mt-0.5">♡</span>
            <span><strong class="text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] font-medium">Shared Rituals:</strong> Turning ordinary screen time into memorable activities like synchronized movie dates and playful cooking battles.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="card-cozy p-8 sm:p-10 text-center bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FFFDF9] to-[#FAF5EE] dark:from-[#261E2C] dark:to-[#1A141F]">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-3 inline-block">🌸</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#2D2226] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] mb-3">Welcome to the Haven</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#78666C] dark:text-[#C4B6BE] max-w-md mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Whether you're separated by three hours on a train or twelve hours on a flight, Will Meet Soon is your sanctuary. Take a deep breath — you're doing wonderfully.
        </p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-lovable bg-[#E15B7B] text-white hover:bg-[#CC4B6B] text-xs px-8 py-3.5 focus-ring">
          Explore the Tools 💌
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
